#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS.rst:2
msgid "CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS.rst:6
msgid ""
"Do not generate ``test_prep/<name>`` and ``test_prep/all`` build targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS.rst:8
msgid ""
"When this variable is set to a true value, CMake does not generate the "
"preparation targets that build the known prerequisites of tests.  See :ref:"
"`Test Preparation Targets`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS.rst:12
msgid ""
"Set this variable in the top-level directory.  It is off by default, in "
"which case the preparation targets are generated."
msgstr ""
